es the cat**: This is directly stated in the context.\n11.**Lion is nice**: This is directly stated in the context.\n12.**If something likes the bear and it visits the lion then it is green**: This is a conditional statement.\n13.**If something likes the lion and the lion is nice then it chases the lion**: This is a conditional statement.\n14.**If something is green and it chases the cow then the cow is cold**: This is a conditional statement.\nThe bear does not chase the cat.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
