- The cow visits the bald eagle.\n   - The cow visits the lion.\n   - The dog is rough.\n   - The lion is young.\n   - The lion does not see the bald eagle.\n   - The lion sees the cow.\n   .\n3.**Dog Information:**.\n   - The dog is rough.\n   - The lion is young.\n   - The lion does not see the bald eagle.\n   - The lion sees the cow.\n   .\n4.**Lion Information:**.\n   - The lion is young.\n   - The lion does not see the bald eagle.\n   - The lion sees the cow.\n   - If someone is big and they do not see the bald eagle then the bald eagle is rough.\n   - If someone is big and they see the lion then they are green.\n   - If someone is big then they visit the dog.The lion is known to be big, young, green, and rough. This is the only option left as the lion cannot be unknown in terms of size.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
