implies Dave is round.\n   - All round things are green, so Dave being round implies Dave is green.\n   - If something is nice and not cold, then it is green.Since Dave is nice and cold, this condition does not apply to Dave.\n   - However, we need to check if Dave being nice and red makes it cold, which would imply Dave is not smart.\n   - Since Dave is nice and red, and red things are nice, and if something is red and nice, then it is cold, Dave being cold implies Dave is not smart.\nTherefore, based on the given information, the statement "Dave is not smart" is false.\n</think>.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
